  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shelter and non-food item assistance and support for displaced populations affected by cyclones Fytia and Gezani in the Boeny and Atsinanana regions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve the living conditions of populations affected by Tropical Cyclones FYTIA and GEZANI through voucher assistance for shelter rehabilitation, as well as support to displaced persons and continuous monitoring of urgent needs to inform the humanitarian response.</narrative>
